# Mission 37 — SOC Write-Up Fundamentals: Failed Logon Analysis

## 🎯 Objective

Practice converting raw Windows security telemetry into a concise, professional SOC analyst write-up.

The exercise focused on:

* Identifying what happened
* Separating evidence from interpretation
* Avoiding unsupported conclusions
* Writing a defensible analyst assessment

